flowchart LR
    %% Release Flow — implementation authority: RELEASING.md, auto-bump.yml, release.yml, ci.yml, and pages.yml

    COMMIT([git push or merge to main]):::terminal

    COMMIT --> CI[".github/workflows/ci.yml<br/>PRs and pushes to main"]:::action
    CI --> CHECKS["python3 -m compileall<br/>validate-static-audit.py<br/>cli.py doctor + clean-install smoke test"]:::action
    CHECKS --> PASSED{CI passed?}:::decision
    PASSED -->|No| FIX([Fix and recommit]):::terminal

    PASSED -->|Yes| CLEAN["Validated main branch"]:::terminal

    COMMIT --> AUTO[".github/workflows/auto-bump.yml<br/>Independently inspects merge commit message"]:::action
    COMMIT --> PAGES[".github/workflows/pages.yml<br/>Deploys documentation site"]:::pages
    PAGES --> SITE([Published to Pages]):::terminal

    AUTO --> MSG_CHK{Commit message prefix?}:::decision
    MSG_CHK -->|major: / BREAKING CHANGE:| MAJOR["Major bump<br/>v&lt;major+1&gt;.0.0"]:::bump
    MSG_CHK -->|minor: / feat: / feature:| MINOR["Minor bump<br/>v&lt;major&gt;.&lt;minor+1&gt;.0"]:::bump
    MSG_CHK -->|patch: / fix: / perf: / revert:| PATCH["Patch bump<br/>v&lt;major&gt;.&lt;minor&gt;.&lt;patch+1&gt;"]:::bump
    MSG_CHK -->|chore: / docs: / refactor: / release:| SKIP["No release<br/>no tag pushed"]:::skip

    MAJOR --> TAG["Commit manifest.json update<br/>git tag vX.Y.Z &amp; push origin"]:::release
    MINOR --> TAG
    PATCH --> TAG

    TAG --> RELEASE_WF[".github/workflows/release.yml<br/>Triggers on v* tags<br/>Re-runs ci.yml workflow"]:::release

    RELEASE_WF --> PKG["Package tar.gz kit archive<br/>verify cli.py &amp; manifest.json"]:::release
    PKG --> GH_RELEASE([GitHub Release created<br/>with asset and release notes]):::terminal

    MANUAL(["Maintainer manual tag<br/>git tag vX.Y.Z && git push origin vX.Y.Z<br/>use release: or [skip release] on commit"]):::manual
    MANUAL --> RELEASE_WF

    classDef terminal fill:#111827,stroke:#111827,color:#fff
    classDef action fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef decision fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#78350f
    classDef bump fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#78350f
    classDef pages fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#fff
    classDef release fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#16a34a,color:#166534
    classDef manual fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea,color:#4c1d95
    classDef skip fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#475569,stroke-dasharray:4 3

    class COMMIT,FIX,CLEAN,SITE,GH_RELEASE terminal
    class CI,CHECKS,AUTO action
    class PASSED,MSG_CHK decision
    class MAJOR,MINOR,PATCH bump
    class PAGES pages
    class TAG,RELEASE_WF,PKG release
    class MANUAL manual
    class SKIP skip
